  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.09 Fee for Replacement of License or Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.09 Fee for Replacement of License or Certificate.\n\n(a) No fee shall be paid for a replacement license or certificate that is issued electronically.\n\n(b) The fee for providing a replacement copy of a license or certificate in hard copy shall be the actual cost of having a vendor produce the license or certificate or $20, whichever is less.\n\nSource. #13264, INTERIM, eff 9-22-21; ss by #13336, eff 1-27-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
